A story from this week that displays how I work under pressure would be receiving an online assessment while still busy with another project. 
To complete the assessment, I had to set some time aside to allow myself time to prepare for the test. This includes practise tests and reviewing notes related to the test. 
I chose to prioritize the project because it has more work to complete. 
After completing majority of the project, I switched the priorities to ensure I can prepare for the assessment. 
This allowed me to prepare as much as possible for the assessment without losing time to focus on my project.
